ghleak (1.3.0-0kali1) kali-dev; urgency=medium

  * Built-in pattern catalog expanded to 57 detectors, merging SecretFinder
    (m4ll0k) and the viralvaghela APK scanner catalogs with modern prefixes:
    private key blocks, GitHub/GitLab/npm/PyPI, Google (AIza, ya29, service
    account JSON), OpenAI/Anthropic, AWS (key id, secret, MWS), Slack
    (tokens + webhooks), Discord, Telegram, Stripe (+webhook secrets),
    Shopify, Square, PayPal Braintree, SendGrid, Mailgun, MailChimp, Twilio
    (key + SIDs), Facebook, Twitter, Heroku, Azure, Jenkins, Grafana,
    New Relic, Doppler, Netlify, JWT, Bearer/Basic headers, credentialed
    DB/Cloudinary URLs, password-in-URL, generic password/api_key/secret
    assignments.
  * Each detector now carries a severity (Critical/High/Medium/Low), included
    in JSON reports and the builtin/<detector> finding name.
  * Placeholder guards extended (YOUR_/EXAMPLE/XXXX/...) for all families.
  * Dedupe is per (detector, value, line) so overlapping detectors both report.
  * Diff-header filter fixed: PEM '-----BEGIN' lines were being skipped as
    '---' diff headers.
  * Python unittest suite added (python/tests/test_patterns.py, 8 tests) and
    Go patterns_test.go expanded to 16 positives + 7 negatives.

 -- Nixon-H <nixon@example.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0000

ghleak (1.2.0-0kali1) kali-dev; urgency=medium

  * Built-in secret pattern scanner (ghp_, gho_, github_pat_, AKIA, AIza,
    sk-ant-, sk-, xox*- , glpat-, SG., JWT, private key formats) that works
    with or without a trufflehog binary; candidates merge with verified
    findings.
  * Rate-limit handling rework: authoritative x-ratelimit-* header tracking,
    proactive pacing under 200 remaining, Retry-After support, exponential
    backoff with jitter on 403/429/5xx, retries instead of silent drops.
  * LLM backends retry 429/5xx with backoff; failed batches no longer poison
    the classifier cache with false "clean" entries.
  * Fixes: --no-only-verified now possible, LLM provider auto-detect order,
    commit owner/repo validation, CSV file handle, corporate cache path,
    squareup.com typo, archive end-hour arithmetic.
  * Go module path corrected to github.com/Nixon-H/ghleak/go.

 -- Nixon-H <nixon@example.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

